{
  "category": "Soft Tissue Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It drives away opponents by excreting a sticky liquid that can dissolve anything. Its eyes devolved, so it can’t see anything.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its four horns are a high-performance radar system. It uses them to sense sounds and smells, rather than using ears or a nose.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It drives away opponents by excreting a sticky liquid that can dissolve anything. Its eyes devolved, so it can’t see anything.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its four horns are a high-performance radar system. It uses them to sense sounds and smells, rather than using ears or a nose.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It has trouble drawing a line between friends and food. It will calmly try to melt and eat even those it gets along well with.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon’s mucous can dissolve anything. Toothless, it sprays mucous on its prey. Once they’re nicely dissolved, it slurps them up.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It crawls along sluggishly. The swirly protrusion on its back is filled with its brain and other organs.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its entire body is covered with gooey mucus that can dissolve anything. Be sure to put gloves on if you’re going to touch it.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although this Pokémon isn’t very strong, its body is coated in a caustic slime that can melt through anything, so predators steer clear of it.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "The lump on its back contains its tiny brain. It thinks only of food and escaping its enemies.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "A creature given to melancholy. I suspect its metallic shell developed as a result of the mucus on its skin reacting with the iron in Hisui's water.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
